		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID e9af5f30-5917-4eae-b0cb-43202474ca4e</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Receiving signal from RC</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">Receiving signal from RC:%0D
After receiving the signal, the receiver should:%0D
1. Validate the recording signal according to the defined requirements.%0D
2. If the signal meets the requirements, send it to the controller for interpretation.%0D
2.1. If the gate was moving at a given moment, it should be stopped, remembering the direction in which it was moving.%0D
2.2. If the gate was at rest, start the movement in the opposite direction to the previous one.%0D
3. If the signal is incorrect, ignore it.%0D
</_text>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">6.2.2026::15:49:6</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">2</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 8d3aebe0-ab9f-41cf-b4db-091785ac1e29</value>
